bridgelink (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release
  * Added Auto-Activation feature for automatic device reconnection
  * Improved polling interval from 5s to 1s for faster detection
  * Added connection monitor daemon for auto-activation
  * Enhanced device listing with auto-activation status
  * Added comprehensive documentation

